WEBVTT

00:21.330 --> 00:24.800
Ian killed the boss and became the Don.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.030
That’s all what the letter from Kiri said.

00:40.730 --> 00:42.320
Long time no see!

00:43.640 --> 00:46.350
Morning, Mi-ha-i!

00:48.460 --> 00:50.660
Hurry up and get off, old man!

00:50.660 --> 00:51.190
Oh!

00:51.190 --> 00:52.470
Oh, excuse me.

00:56.560 --> 00:59.430
Morning, Kiri.

01:10.350 --> 01:14.010
Good job finding out where I was moving to.

01:14.770 --> 01:19.000
This city isn’t as large as you think it is.

01:19.000 --> 01:20.020
I guess.

01:20.820 --> 01:24.100
Wherever I go, this cold is the only thing that doesn’t change.

01:27.560 --> 01:29.290
Ma- I’m sorry!

01:30.470 --> 01:32.660
Not at all, be careful.

01:32.740 --> 01:34.070
Oh, yes.

01:40.310 --> 01:41.760
15 years ago…

01:47.440 --> 01:52.630
The boss forced Ian on me… a hitman.

01:53.790 --> 02:00.010
This is my son. Teach him your skills… I don’t care how long it takes.

02:04.100 --> 02:08.060
To the boss, Ian was only something he inherited from the funeral.

02:09.110 --> 02:10.870
You could tell just by looking at his face.

02:11.470 --> 02:16.480
Born a little more than ten years ago, he had a mature face that had never seen parental love.

02:18.530 --> 02:23.160
At the start of this year, he apparently said “Happy New Year, Dad!”

02:23.160 --> 02:25.010
And pulled the trigger.

02:37.780 --> 02:39.740
Is it still stuck in the wall?

02:40.960 --> 02:44.400
That’s the only photo with Milena in it.

02:44.830 --> 02:47.410
Since you burned all of them.

02:52.210 --> 02:56.980
Milena, together with Kiri, was a prostitute at this bar.

03:21.490 --> 03:25.280
Milena would always be near Ian and me.

03:31.610 --> 03:35.030
Being in love with a prostitute is not a good feeling.

03:55.100 --> 03:59.820
But despite that, I think we did pretty well.

04:00.610 --> 04:04.850
But, that day ten years ago…

04:11.210 --> 04:15.760
What? You’re early, Mihai!

04:27.110 --> 04:29.510
Ian!

04:36.780 --> 04:40.520
After pointing my gun at the boss’s son I, was fired from the organization.

04:41.230 --> 04:44.750
I was never able to figure out why Ian killed her.

04:46.250 --> 04:48.530
What are you going to do from now on?

04:48.780 --> 04:53.040
He’ll probably know by tonight that you’ve come.

04:54.450 --> 04:58.770
Tomorrow, I’m going to Milena’s grave.

04:59.500 --> 05:00.770
Are you serious?

05:01.360 --> 05:04.780
You wrote me that letter knowing that, didn’t you?

05:07.050 --> 05:08.050
True.

05:09.240 --> 05:13.050
Your room on the second floor is left the way it was.

05:14.150 --> 05:15.290
Thanks.

05:18.340 --> 05:22.030
Doing a thing like this… The job the boss gave you-!

05:22.890 --> 05:26.060
Don’t make so much noise. You’ll disturb the neighbors.

05:26.940 --> 05:30.540
You can only say one thing right now.

05:30.540 --> 05:35.310
Will you pledge your loyalty to me?

05:35.310 --> 05:38.480
Yes or no, that’s it.

05:38.810 --> 05:40.780
Don’t underestimate me, you brat!

05:40.780 --> 05:45.050
Did you think that just by killing the boss will get you the family?

05:45.050 --> 05:47.950
Acting arrogantly while pretending to be the boss will soon-

05:49.600 --> 05:52.290
He just couldn’t remember things well.

05:52.290 --> 05:54.930
Didn’t I say “Yes or no”?

05:55.380 --> 05:57.160
Oh, shit,

05:57.160 --> 06:00.300
gunshots also disturb the neighbors.

06:03.120 --> 06:05.470
Boss, may I speak?

06:10.110 --> 06:13.770
It’s ten years too early for you to be shooting with one hand.

06:13.770 --> 06:16.960
Stop trying to look cool. Use both hands and aim properly.

06:22.580 --> 06:23.720
Behind you, Ian!

06:23.720 --> 06:24.180
What?

06:28.450 --> 06:31.200
Carelessness is your worst enemy.

06:31.200 --> 06:32.530
What are you doing?

06:32.840 --> 06:37.010
In our trade, you’ll never know when or where you’ll get shot.

06:37.390 --> 06:39.100
Have eyes on the back of your head.

06:40.150 --> 06:42.310
Just saying that doesn’t mean I can do that.

06:43.400 --> 06:45.050
Morning, gentlemen!

06:45.600 --> 06:47.670
You’re fighting just like father and son!

06:50.100 --> 06:52.070
Morning, Ian!

06:52.580 --> 06:53.770
Morning.

06:56.570 --> 06:58.450
You’ve got to work now, as well?

06:58.450 --> 07:01.340
I thought we could eat before I went to the store.

07:01.340 --> 07:03.080
Huh, you’re cooking?

07:03.080 --> 07:07.530
What, are you unsure about my cooking?

07:07.530 --> 07:11.660
Your stew’s too salty… Stop pressing your breasts against me!

07:11.660 --> 07:14.320
What about my stew?

07:14.320 --> 07:16.710
Uh, well, it’s…

07:22.370 --> 07:23.390
Why?

07:24.370 --> 07:26.420
Why did he come back now?

07:26.840 --> 07:27.850
Mihai…

07:29.180 --> 07:33.670
Tomorrow, he’ll probably go meet Mihai.

07:33.670 --> 07:35.430
This is your chance.

07:35.880 --> 07:38.700
Did you adore your previous boss that much?

07:40.330 --> 07:44.100
Me? Does it look like it?

07:50.080 --> 07:52.580
Mihai, do you love Milena?

07:53.040 --> 07:54.920
What are you talking about?

07:54.920 --> 07:56.850
Are you into older girls?

07:57.180 --> 07:59.080
I’m not talking about that.

08:00.380 --> 08:02.350
Do you hate Milena?

08:15.790 --> 08:16.570
Ian…

08:17.030 --> 08:19.570
How should I have responded?

08:35.650 --> 08:40.390
Milena, I didn’t think I’d ever come back here, but…

08:41.360 --> 08:43.900
No, I probably knew already,

08:44.040 --> 08:50.500
that Ian and I would still be broken when I came here like this.

08:56.340 --> 08:58.350
Has it been ten years?

08:58.350 --> 09:00.510
Yeah, ten years.

09:01.140 --> 09:04.520
How is sitting in the Don’s chair like?

09:04.520 --> 09:05.920
Comfortable?

09:06.160 --> 09:10.420
It’s been hard getting used to it. I don’t have time to sit.

09:16.620 --> 09:19.600
Your gun is so nostalgic.

09:23.040 --> 09:27.810
Ultimately you didn’t shoot me then.

09:39.610 --> 09:44.560
Did you come back to finally get back at me, whom you failed to kill that time?

09:56.750 --> 09:57.570
Why…

09:58.260 --> 09:59.840
…did you kill Milena?

10:00.230 --> 10:02.080
I’ve told you repeatedly until now…

10:07.130 --> 10:10.610
I didn’t know why you killed Milena.

10:10.610 --> 10:14.720
So, I wanted to hear your reason.

10:15.740 --> 10:17.590
Because you’re like that…!

10:20.160 --> 10:23.380
Your impatience is still the same.

10:23.380 --> 10:26.000
It’s like my feelings from back then are coming back.

10:26.090 --> 10:26.950
Not good…

10:47.800 --> 10:51.420
Mihai, you’re being targeted!

10:58.710 --> 11:01.630
Behind you, Ian!

11:20.420 --> 11:24.160
I was jealous of Milena.

11:24.160 --> 11:26.010
Because she was a good person.

11:27.520 --> 11:30.660
I loved you.

11:31.030 --> 11:34.670
You looked much more fatherly than my old man.

11:35.440 --> 11:39.940
But, I’m the child my old man forced a prostitute to bear.

11:39.940 --> 11:42.670
I didn’t understand how a mother should be like.

11:44.130 --> 11:47.510
Is a person like Milena called a mother?

11:48.070 --> 11:52.560
To me, she only looked like a woman who was trying to steal you from me.

11:53.560 --> 11:57.430
I wanted to keep my first dad to myself.

11:59.300 --> 12:04.880
Killing my old man and becoming boss was out of desperation as well.

12:04.880 --> 12:07.700
Thanks to that, I paid a horrible price.

12:08.380 --> 12:11.060
Really, what a mess!

12:12.790 --> 12:14.970
Can you be relieved for me,

12:16.200 --> 12:17.480
Father?

12:18.560 --> 12:21.480
I was afraid of being called that.

12:22.340 --> 12:25.130
I didn’t want to realize how foolish I was.

12:25.580 --> 12:30.400
I feared losing you, even though you killed Milena,

12:31.660 --> 12:35.000
like I lost my common sense not too long ago.

12:37.020 --> 12:42.500
Really, losing me…

13:03.110 --> 13:05.260
Really, that girl Kiri…

13:05.570 --> 13:09.660
Don’t make me go shopping when I’m not completely healed yet.

13:16.440 --> 13:18.060
Ouch!

13:18.060 --> 13:19.270
I’m sorry.

13:20.100 --> 13:21.270
What?

13:28.410 --> 13:31.580
Now, everyone who knows everything will die.

13:57.330 --> 14:01.780
I can’t afford to die yet, can I?

14:04.540 --> 14:06.350
Milena…

14:08.840 --> 14:10.130
Ian…
